31a8a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8b1a4d1/uploads/origins/d1d8cc4f-1f01-42cd-8be9-188f5c629916?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e2ba5cb425a0c524fcc6f7e9d4831a8a, https://si.imgix.net/f8b1a4d1/uploads/origins/d1d8cc4f-1f01-42cd-8be9-188f5c629916?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a6bc1600b4035cc1c4196db7f3d0d048 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8b1a4d1/uploads/origins/d1d8cc4f-1f01-42cd-8be9-188f5c629916?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=42d4fbaf8bebd94b6d80d4517b10f406 3x"}, "body": "Dear Dr. Akami\n\nMy name is AI.\nI would like to request you to draw an illustration of Kinako Kashii, a forest diva and mushroom-based personal Vtuber, in her new costume (announced on December 1, 2024).\nAs we have requested before, we would like you to use your very cute and wonderful drawings to depict Kinako Kashii in her new costume singing in a cool, cute, and mysterious way.\nWe would be very happy if you could depict the coolness and mystique of Kinako Kashii in a cute and charming manner, and motivate her to sing in the song frame.\nThere are no three-sided drawings, and there are various differences, but we would like to ask you to use any combination you like.\n(Personally, I would be happy if you could draw all of them in full, or if it would be too complicated, in the simplest form.)\n\n[Intended use.\nAs a gift to Ms. Kinako Kashii herself.\nThumbnails for our monetized Youtube channel\nThumbnails for our monetized Youtube channel.\n\nImage\nWe may have asked for a lot of details above, but we would appreciate it if you could draw the image freely in the world of Ms. Akami, with expressions and compositions that are not cute or cool. We would appreciate it if you could add a microphone as well, since we are planning to use it in a singing frame.\n\n\nReference materials\nhttps://x.com/kinako_kashii/status/1863216351399342474\n\nRequests\nWe would appreciate it if you could do the following so that we can easily use them as thumbnails.\nAt least the left, right and top are not cut off.\nPSDs (or transparent PNGs of each) with the background and characters layered.\n\nIf the price is not acceptable, please resend.\nThank you in advance for your cooperation.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@cJKKCqQMvP/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2228011, "client_id": 3236574, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/be96e9e7/uploads/origins/052a5d85-6dbb-458c-876f-967d57654d1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce26682263b2d71a02ef4a93e9db49ad", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/be96e9e7/uploads/origins/052a5d85-6dbb-458c-876f-967d57654d1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce26682263b2d71a02ef4a93e9db49ad, https://si.imgix.net/be96e9e7/uploads/origins/052a5d85-6dbb-458c-876f-967d57654d1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8dab3b0bf07a1619948d93c69136f027 2x, https://si.imgix.net/be96e9e7/uploads/origins/052a5d85-6dbb-458c-876f-967d57654d1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7da690bebbc05ff36f5099e0643351d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/be96e9e7/uploads/origins/052a5d85-6dbb-458c-876f-967d57654d1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f9ae988c85a36fa6c7d62932bda69f52", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/be96e9e7/uploads/origins/052a5d85-6dbb-458c-876f-967d57654d1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f9ae988c85a36fa6c7d62932bda69f52, https://si.imgix.net/be96e9e7/uploads/origins/052a5d85-6dbb-458c-876f-967d57654d1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bd5a9e87daacad6693cb76e5ef3e5d97 2x, https://si.imgix.net/be96e9e7/uploads/origins/052a5d85-6dbb-458c-876f-967d57654d1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f60d64d657b0856af9e465050e14759 3x"}, "body": "Dear Dr. Akami\n\nThank you for your continued support.\nMy name is AI.\nThank you very much for drawing the wonderful work of V-tuber Kinako Kashii the other day.\n\nI was so impressed by the wonderful work of the above-mentioned artist that I requested you to draw an illustration for my personal use (I still do not have a fixed one, which I felt inconvenient).\nI would be very grateful if you could draw the following profile picture/icon of my own personal favorite application in your very nice taste.\n\nI would like to use them for the following purposes.\nI would like to use it as my profile picture and icon on several SNS (X, YouTube, fanbox, etc.). Therefore, only the illustration from the neck up is acceptable. The format of the data to be delivered should be any format that would not be a problem even for an amateur like me.\n\nImage\nThe illustration should be a pop, slightly handsome \"Kuya Shonin\" (see reference below) type figure with a mushroom growing on his head (without hair) and six mushrooms of various kinds coming out of his mouth (✕ spitting out), like the \"Kuya Shonin\" image. The mushrooms on the head should be similar to the mushrooms that grow on Kinako Kashii's original free material character \"Shiitake-kun\" (see reference below). As for the type of mushrooms that come out of the mouth, we would like you to draw the characteristic types of mushrooms: safflower mushroom, kaentake mushroom, honshimeji mushroom, matsutake mushroom, kinugasa mushroom, and eringi mushroom. However, any kind of mushrooms will be fine as long as you draw something that reflects your taste and looks good.\n\nWe would like to leave it up to you to decide whether you want the overall atmosphere to be cute and pop or dubious. We would appreciate it if you could freely draw it as you wish in your own worldview.\n\nReference materials\nStanding Kuya Shonin\nhttps://www.tnm.jp/modules/r_free_page/index.php?id=2129\n\nShiitake-kun\nhttps://lit.link/KinakoKashii\n(There is an image of Shiitake-kun at the bottom of the page.)\n\nIf the amount of money, etc. does not seem to be sufficient, please resend the request.\nThank you in advance.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@cJKKCqQMvP/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2228011, "client_id": 3236574, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/03505446/uploads/origins/3e6bdd56-aaf3-400c-a668-28df5776eee2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57df46b5eb5eea994e03f2d50fbe3dc3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/03505446/uploads/origins/3e6bdd56-aaf3-400c-a668-28df5776eee2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57df46b5eb5eea994e03f2d50fbe3dc3, https://si.imgix.net/03505446/uploads/origins/3e6bdd56-aaf3-400c-a668-28df5776eee2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=42cc54b5b159bcc7454f80ebab256620 2x, https://si.imgix.net/03505446/uploads/origins/3e6bdd56-aaf3-400c-a668-28df5776eee2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97190adcbeb6ef89e0139c6bbca3973a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/03505446/uploads/origins/3e6bdd56-aaf3-400c-a668-28df5776eee2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8f0eebf94f6b461082b8a9a6c9811bdb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/03505446/uploads/origins/3e6bdd56-aaf3-400c-a668-28df5776eee2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8f0eebf94f6b461082b8a9a6c9811bdb, https://si.imgix.net/03505446/uploads/origins/3e6bdd56-aaf3-400c-a668-28df5776eee2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a79712a30d39ae3defacac2e2196e3f3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/03505446/uploads/origins/3e6bdd56-aaf3-400c-a668-28df5776eee2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4fd1f47380733410c11a4b10fbe9442c 3x"}, "body": "Dear Dr. Akami\n\nMy name is AI.\nI would like to request you to draw an illustration of Kinako Kashii, an individual Vtuber of mushrooms.\nI would like you to draw Kinako Kashii singing in a cool and cute way with your very cute and wonderful drawings.\nWe would like to see her singing in a cute and charming way (powerful and interesting, but with a bit of a shadow). If this is a difficult request, we would appreciate it if you could draw a work that would motivate Kinako Kashii to sing.\n\nIntended use.\nAs a gift to Ms. Kinako Kashii herself.\nThumbnails for her monetized Youtube channel\nPosting on social networking sites such as X\n\nImage\nWe may have asked for a lot of details above, but we would appreciate it if you could draw freely in the world of Ms. Akami, except for the expressions and composition, etc., which should be cute and cool.\n\n\nReference materials\n(three-sided drawing, etc.)\nhttps://x.com/kinako_kashii/status/1742885558253416946\n\nRequests\nWe would appreciate it if you could do the following so that we can easily use them as thumbnails.\nAt least the left, right and top are not cut off.\nPSDs (or transparent PNGs of each) with the background and characters layered.\n\nIf the price is not acceptable, please resend.\nThank you in advance for your cooperation.", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@cJKKCqQM