iginal SD character.\n\nWe would like you to draw a boy SD character with a cat and rice cakes as motifs.\nWe would like the hair style to be like Vtuber Kano's, and the hair color to be a light blue.\nhttps://twitter.com/Kanae_2434/status/1662261546989539328\n\nOther than that, everything else is up to you. I would like you to draw a character that you think is cute.\nThe illustration will be used as the icon for X.\n\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 5374, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "いーたん＆mikokoたん", "screen_name": "mikoko1", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1610031912646750209/1qqEk7cE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/106337453/1782415977/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 71, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 575302, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "PoPooch-ぽぽち", "screen_name": "po_pooch", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1508010159490363394/feC8RMrV.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3233092416/1648303536/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "video"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 1175523, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "異常なし", "screen_name": "tensentensen", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_imag